字节跳动-7677893421384665349.description:
1、达人运营与关系维护：通过一对一沟通及社群运营等方式，与达人建立并维护长期合作关系，提升达人活跃度、参与度及持续成长；
2、达人成长规划：制定季度及月度头部达人运营计划，提升达人优质内容数量，同时帮助达人提升在电商平台上的商业变现能力；
3、达人教育与培训：策划并执行线上及线下达人活动、培训和内容教育，提升达人内容质量及对电商平台规则、政策和工具的理解；
4、商家达人撮合：品牌及商家建立合作关系，挖掘商品与达人之间的合作机会，推动优质商品与达人高效匹配，实现平台健康增长；
5、项目协同与落地：与内部及外部相关团队协作，策划并执行以达人增长为核心的项目和活动，推动业务目标达成。

1.Growing and nurturing creators via both one-to-one and community-wide management and communication. Directly responsible for core GMV target;
2.Develop quarterly and monthly operation plans for creators to boost their level of growth and increase creators' earning potential on the eCommerce Platform;
3.Design and implement internal learning programs and policy enablement for creators, and translate these insights into strategic external initiatives to drive creator engagement and growth;
4.Coordinate with brands and sellers to build partnerships and collaborations with creators to achieve healthy platform growth;
5.Execute ad hoc creator projects and initiatives, ensuring smooth collaboration across internal and external stakeholders while unlocking value and benefits for creators.

